      "ExternalDescriptionStr": "<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Job Title:</span> Swim &amp; Dive Student Manager (WS-ST2)</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Classification: </span>Student Employee (non-exempt)</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Name and Address of Employer: </span>St. Olaf College, 1520 St. Olaf Ave, Northfield, MN 55057</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">If the position requires the student to work off campus, provide the name and address here:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Department Name:</span> Athletics</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Unit Number (5 digits): 010-11725</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Length of Position: </span>See Employment Authorization<span style=\"font-weight:700\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Contact Person/Supervisor: </span>Head Men’s and Women’s Swim Coach</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Wage Range: </span>$12.00-13.00/hour</p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Description of the Position: (Purpose of the Position):</span> The Swim &amp; Dive Student Manager role supports&nbsp;all aspects of team life including workout support, administrative support, data entry, time taking and various other managements for meets and everyday practice.&nbsp;</p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Transferable Skills:</span> Include but are not limited to those of organization, leadership, coaching, instruction, and time management.&nbsp;</p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Duties and Responsibilities: </span>Include daily workout&nbsp;support&nbsp;in the&nbsp;form of split taking,&nbsp;videoing, technical support, and other&nbsp;duties directed by the coaches.&nbsp;</p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Qualifications: (Education/Experience/Skills)</span> Applicants should have a background in competitive swimming, computer skills, data entry, as well as friendly, professional relationships with peers and staff.</p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Physical and Environmental Factors:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\">This position requires exposure to loud noise, respiratory factors, chemicals, and wet or humid conditions indoors to perform the essential functions. Candidates must possess the ability to safely perform the physical work required of all duties with or without reasonable accommodation.</p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">This job description is for general information purposes.&nbsp; It is not intended to list all duties and responsibilities of the position.&nbsp; This job description is subject to change at any time by St. Olaf College, with or without prior notice.</span></p>\n<div>\n <span style=\"font-weight:700\"><br></span>\n</div>",
